{"id":"613214","name":"花型馒头","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/613214/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"低粉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"260克"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"20克"}],"sub":[{"name":"干酵母粉","amount":"5克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"温牛奶260克加入干酵母，白糖搅拌均匀。","img":"images/613214/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入低粉500克。","img":"images/613214/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/613214/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"分别分成5分小面团。","img":"images/613214/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取一份揉成长条形。","img":"images/613214/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"然后成长条形面团垒起来。","img":"images/613214/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用一根筷子从中间轻轻压下去。","img":"images/613214/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"然后两边固定好。","img":"images/613214/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入蒸锅，发酵50分钟，两倍大。","img":"images/613214/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"焖五分钟，在取出来！","img":"images/613214/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}